# The end pass (OI-REF-01): every line on both host kinds, before items/refactor merges into beta.
# Generated from gate.sh by R8 (#404). A line is a gate run by name; @player and @dedicated mark the
# runs only one host kind takes. Run it twice, one pass per host kind:
#   RUNS="$(grep -v @dedicated DevTools/Scenarios/end-pass.runs)" PAIRS="p:2" DevTools/Scenarios/gate.sh
#   RUNS="$(grep -v @player DevTools/Scenarios/end-pass.runs)" PAIRS="d:2" DevTools/Scenarios/gate.sh
# Known bugs ([KnownBug]) count as KNOWN, not FAIL. shop-restock fails while shops are paused (no shop
# scanner): its result is recorded, not fixed here.

